  "summary": "The CM3500 controller in ClimateMaster commercial DOAS units has a short fixed BACnet list: Binary Values for the network occupancy command, alarm reset and on/off status of fans, wheel, compressors and condenser fans, and Analog Values for pressures, air temperatures, humidity, output commands and two writable setpoints.",
